# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PENDING CONDUCTOR RULING, not a permanent exclusion.
#
# Research corpus and lane coordination material. Deliberately untracked in the first
# commit rather than swept in, because this repo is intended to gain a GitHub remote and
# git history is forever. A three-way credential scan over these paths (key shapes, AWS /
# Slack / Stripe / GitHub token shapes, password prose) came back clean on 2026-08-12, so
# this is caution about scope, not a known finding: T1-FOUNDATION 4.11 records that the
# seeding corpus carries live plaintext credentials, flagged twice, and "the scan I ran
# found nothing" is not the same claim as "there is nothing".
#
# TO INCLUDE THEM: the conductor rules that research material belongs in the deployable
# repo, somebody re-runs the scan, and these three lines are deleted in one commit.
# .vercelignore already keeps them out of every build regardless.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_intel/
HANDOFFS/
.terminal-claims.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE DATA DIRECTORY. NEVER COMMITTED, AND THIS REPO IS PUBLIC.
#
# `data/` holds the government feed files and the four seed workbooks. Two of those
# workbooks carry the name, city, state, PHONE NUMBER and EMAIL of 3,471 real companies,
# and all four together are the entire analytical edge of this product.
#
# github.com/dhitch11/onlysource is a PUBLIC repository. Verified 2026-08-14 against the
# GitHub API, which answered 200 to an unauthenticated request. Anything committed here is
# world-readable forever and is not recoverable by deleting the commit.
#
# The app therefore NEVER reads data from a tracked path. It resolves the root at runtime
# through lib/data-root.ts, and when the directory is absent every surface renders its
# stated empty state rather than a blank or a zero. Deployments ship this directory as an
# included file, out of band, never through git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/data/

# Conductor scratch: probes, NSN lists, one-off verification scripts. Never committed.
/.probe/

# Server-side app state (alert settings, etc.) — never in the repo
.state/
*openrouter.env
